      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>To the illustrious, liberal, and pious scholar, the accomplished rayyis, the chief over the leaders of the house of</li>\n<li>Levi, our master \u1e24alf\u014dn, son of his honor, Nethanel, may the All(merciful) pre(serve him).</li>\n<li>His favorite, who is proud of him and yearns after</li>\n<li>his presence, Joseph ha-Levi, son of Samuel Ibn al-Ukht\u016bsh, m(ay he rest in) E(den). Peace.</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
